<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Romanji</para>
  <para style="toc1">Epistola Cãtrã Romanji</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romanji</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt1">Epistola Cãtrã Romanji</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Pavlu, huzmichear al Hristolu Isus, acljimat tra s-hibã apostul sh-aleptu trã evanghelu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Aestu evanghelu tsi Dumnidzãlu u tãxi ma-nãinti prit prufitsilji a lui tu Sãmtili Scrituri, <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />ti Hiljilu a lui, nãscut dit fara al David dupã trup, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />tsi s-arãdãpsi Hiljiu al Dumnidzãu tu puteari dupã Duhlu Sãmtu prit nyearea dit mortsã, Isus Hristos Domnul a nostru. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Prit nãsu noi avem loat har sh-apostulii, trã adutseari ascultarea a pistiljei ntru tuti fãrili trã numa a lui, <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />la cai hits sh-voi acljimatslji al Isus Hristos.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Vã scriu a tutulor tsi hits Roma, vruts di la Dumnidzãlu, acljimats tra s-hits sãmtsã:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Har sh-pace a voauã di la Dumnidzãlu, Tatãl a nostru sh-di la Domnul Isus Hristos.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vrearea al Pavlu trã Vizitari Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Nãinti di tuti hãristisescu Dumnidzãlu a meu prit Isus Hristos trã tuts voi, cã pistea a voastrã ma s-hãbãrseashti tu tutã lumea. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Dumnidzãlu, a cui lji huzmitipsescu cu duhlu a meu prit evanghelu a Hiljilui a lui, easti martirlu a meu cã cum mini nidãnãsit vã aduc aminti, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />tu rugãciunjili a meali totãna spigiurãnda cã, vahi tora tu soni va nji si fac ambarã prit vrearea al Dumnidzãu s-yinã la voi. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Voi multu s-vã ved tra s-mpartu cu voi vãrã doarã duhuroasã tsi voi s-vã nvãrtushits, <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />tra s-nã inimusim deadun cu voi, prit pistea a unui-alantu, pistea a voastrã sh-a mea.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Voi s-shtits, frats sh-surãri a meali, cã di multi ori aveam tu minti s-yineam la voi tra s-aveam vãrã frut shi ntrã voi ashãtsi di cum am avut shi ntrã alti fãri, ma pãnã tora fui nchidicat. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Mini lj-mprumutedz a gretsilor sh-a barbarilor, a shtiutslor sh-a nishtiutslor. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ashãtsi, ti cãt si spindzurã di mini, escu etimu s-vã dimãndu evanghelu sh-a voauã tsi hits Roma. <verse eid="ROM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Cã mini nu am rushini di evanghelu, cã elu easti putearea al Dumnidzãu trã ascãparea a cathiunui cai pistipseashti, ma nãinti Iudeu sh-apoea Pãngãnlu. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Cã ndriptatea al Dumnidzãu easti aspusã tu nãsu dit pisti tu pisti cum easti scriatã: “Ndreptul va bãneadzã prit pisti.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inatea al Dumnidzãu cu Oaminjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Cã inatea al Dumnidzãu s-discupireashti dit tser pri tuti nidumnidzãsirili sh-nindriptãtsili a oaminjlor tsi neacã alihea cu nindriptãtsili a lor, <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />cã atsea tsi poati si s-cunoascã di la Dumnidzãlu easti aspusã tu elji, cã Dumnidzãlu lã u-aspusi a lor. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ashãtsi, calitãtsili a lui atseali nividzutili, fuchia a lui di daima sh-natura a lui dumnidzãsitã, hinda vidzuti prit faptili a lui di cu adrarea a lumiljei, s-veadã curatã cã oaminjlji s-hibã discãbãtitsã. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Cã, cu tutã cã-l cunuscurã Dumnidzãlu nu-l multumãrirã sh-nu lu hãristisirã ca Dumnidzã, ma s-featsirã fãrã minti tu minduirili a lor sh-inima a lor nisãmtsãtã si scudisi. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Dzãcãnda cã suntu mintimenji, agiumsirã glari. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Elji u-alãxirã mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui nimuritor cu undzita a icoaniljei a unui om muritor, a puljilor, a prãvdzãlor cu patru cicioari sh-a azvãrnãtoarilor. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Trã atsea Dumnidzãlu lji alãsã atselji tu orixili a ininjilor a lor tu lãvushituri tra si s-pãnĝãneascã trupurili a lor cu un-alantu. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Elji alãxirã alihea al Dumnidzãu tu arãdeari sh-alãvdarã sh-lji huzmitipsirã a adãrãturiljei, andi s-lji huzmitipsea a Adãrãtorlui, tsi easti ghinicuvintat di totãna. Amin!<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Trã atsea, Dumnidzãlu lji alãsã atselji tu orixi arushinoasi, cã sh-muljerili a lor li alãxirã relatsili a lor naturali tu atsea tsi easti contra di natura. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Tut ashã sh-bãrbatslji, alãsãnda relatsili a lor naturali cu muljerili, s-apreasirã tu orixili a lor cu un-alantu. Adrãnda lucri arushinoasi bãrbats cu bãrbats, loarã cu nãshi arãsplata tsi prindea trã cãbatea a lor.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Metsi elji nu vidzurã ca ndreptu s-cunushtea Dumnidzãlu, aestu li alãsã tu unã minti zurlã, trã fãtseari lucri tsi nu prindi si s-fac. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Elji suntu mplinji di itsi nindriptati, arãutati, nifãntiri sh-arali, mplinji di nchizmã, vãtãmãri, ngrãnji, ilei, arãu-fãcãturi, munaficlãchi, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />cacuzburãtori, aurãscu Dumnidzãlu, violenti, pirifanji, alãvdãtori, masturi di arãutãtsi, niascultãtori di pãrintsã, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />nipututs trã achicãsiri, nipistimenji, fãrã di vreari, fãrã di njilã. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Elji cu tutã cã cunuscurã dimãndarea atsea ndreapta al Dumnidzãu, cã atselji tsi fac ahtãri lucri hãrzãeascã moartea, nu mash cã li fac atseali, ma dau sh-ndriptati la atselji tsi li-adarã.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Giudicata atsea Ndreapta al Dumnidzãu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Trã atsea, tini om, nu eshti fãrã cãbati. Caitsido s-hii tini tsi giudits vãrã altu, tini idyiul ti condamnji, cã ahtãri lucri fats sh-tini. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Tora noi u shtim cã giudicata a Dumnidzãlui easti dupã alihea ti atselji tsi fac ahtãri lucri. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Mindueshti tini, vahi lai om, tsi giudits atselji cai fac ahtãri lucri, cã sh-tini li fats, cã va s-ascachi di giudicata al Dumnidzãu? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Icã li dispretsueshti ayishtearili a bunãtatiljei a lui, a arãvdariljei sh-a bunã-geanlui a lui, nishtinda cã bunãtatea a lui ti dutsi tu pishmãnipsiri?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ma, trã itia a asprimiljei a ta sh-a inimãljei nipishmãnipsit ma adunji trã tini inatea ti dzua a inatiljei al Dumnidzãu cãndu va s-aspunã giudicata atsea ndreapta a lui, <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />tsi va arãsplãteascã cathiunu dupã faptili a lui. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Atsilor tsi ipiminisescu tu fapti buni sh-caftã mãriri, tinjii sh-nimuriri, elu va u-da banã eternã. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Iarã atsilor tsi suntu egoishtsi sh-arnipseascã alihea, shi s-cãndãrseascã a nindriptatiljei, elu va lã da inati sh-turbari. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Munduiri sh-strimturã va aibã pri cathi suflit di om tsi fatsi arãu, cum Iudeulu ma nãinti, apoia sh-Pãngãnlu. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ma mãriri, tinjii sh-pace a cathiunui tsi fatsi buna, ma nãinti a Idueului sh-apoea a Pãngãnlui, <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />cã Dumnidzãlu nu tsãni cu hãtãri.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Tuts atselji tsi amãrtisirã fãrã di lege, va chearã fãrã di lege sh-tuts atselji tsi amãrtisirã cu legea, va si s-giudicã prit legea. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Cã nu suntu ndreptsã nãintea al Dumnidzãu atselji cai avdu legea, ma atselji cai u facã legea, atselji va si s-acljeamã ndreptsã. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Cãndu pãngãnjlji, nu u-au legea, elji li facã singur lucrili tsi cafti legea, iarã niavãnda lege s-fac lege singur ntrã elji. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Elji aspun dimãndãciunjili a legiljei scriati tu ininjli a lor, trã mãrtiria tsi da conshtintsa a lor sh-iarã namisa di nãshi, minduirili lji cãbãteadzã sh-lji discãbãteadzã, <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />tu dzua cãndu Dumnidzãlu va giudicã ascumtili a oaminjlor dupã evanghelu a meu prit Hristolu Isus.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iudeilji sh-Legea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ma, macã tini ti acljenji Iudeu, eshti andupirat tu lege sh-alavdzã Dumnidzãlu, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />cunoshti vrearea a lui, aledzi atseali tsi axizescu, hinda nvitsat prit legea, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />eshti cãndãrsit cã eshti cãlãuzlu a orghilor, lunjinã trã atselji tsi suntu tu scutidi, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />urnipsitor atsilor fãrã-minti, nvitsãtor a cilimenjilor, avãnda tu lege forma a shtintsãljei sh-a alihiljei. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Tini tsi nvets altsãlji, nu ti nvets tini ma nãinti? Tini tsi preditsi s-nu furii, tini furii? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Tini tsi dzãtsi cã nu prindi s-caltsã curunea, u-caltsi? Tini tsi ai aĝunos di idolji, tini furii templjli? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Tini tsi ti alavdzã cu legea, nu lu tinjiseshti Dumnidzãlu cãlcãnda legea? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Cã ashãtsi cum easti scriatã: “Trã itia a voastrã, numa al Dumnidzãu s-blastimã ntrã pãngãnjlji.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:2">Isa 52:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Anvãrliga-tãljearea axizeashti macã tini urmedzi legea, ma, macã tini eshti cãlcãtor a legiljei, anvãrliga-tãljearea a ta easti faptã nianvãrliga-tãljeari. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Trã atsea, un nianvãrliga-tãljeat macã veaglji dimãndãciunjili a legiljei, nu va s-lugurseascã nianvãrliga-tãljearea a lui ca anvãrliga-tãljeari? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Omlu nianvãrliga-tãljeat di naturã, tsi mplineashti legea, va ti giudicã tini tsi, cu tutã litera a legiljei sh-cu anvãrliga-tãljearea a ta, eshti cãlcãtor a legiljei. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Cã, nu easti Iudeu atsel cai s-veadi di nafoarã sh-anvãrliga-tãljearea nu easti atsea tsi s-aspuni tu trup. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ma Iudeu easti atsel cai easti ahtar di nãuntru sh-anvãrliga-tãljearea easti atsea a inimãljei tu Duh, nu tu literã. Alãvdarea a lui nu easti di la oaminji ma di la Dumnidzãlu.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Pistimeniljea al Dumnidzãu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Cai easti nãintarea a Iudeului, icã cai easti ufelia a anvãrliga-tãljeariljei? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Mari tu tuti soili. Prota, cã a Iudeilor lã si pistipsirã zboarili al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Sh-tsi deapoea, macã niscãntsã nu pistipsirã? Nacã nipistipsirea a lor va u-anuleadzã pistimeniljea a Dumnidzãlui? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Diparti s-hibã! Dumnidzãlu s-hibã alihios sh-cathi om arãdios, ashã cum easti scriatã trã Dumnidzãlu: “Tra s-ti discãbãteshti tu zboarili a tali sh-ashã va nichiseshti cãndu s-ti giudits.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Ps 51:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ma, macã nindriptatea a noastrã aspuni ndriptatea a Dumnidzãlui, tsi s-dzãtsem atumtsea? Dumnidzãlu, cãndu s-nãreashti easti nindreptu? (Ma grescu ca om.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Pute s-nu hibã! Cã atumtsea, cum va u giudica lumea Dumnidzãlu? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Trã atsea, “Macã cu arãdearea a mea, alihea a Dumnidzãlui u-analtsã mãrirea a lui, cãtse mini mi giudic ninga ca amãrtios?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Cãtse s-nu dzãtsem ca niscãntsã tsi cacuzburãscu sh-dzãcã vahi noi dzãtsem, “S-fãtsem arãu tra s-aflãm ghini”? Ahtari condamnari easti ndreaptã.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vãrã Nu Easti Ndreptu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Tsi s-dzãtsem tora? Avem noi tsiva ma multu dicãt elji? Sigur, cã nu. Cã, ma nãinti noi lã acuzãm cum Iudeilji ashãtsi sh-Pãngãnjlji cã tuts suntu sum amãrtii. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Ashã cum easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Vãrã nu easti ndreptu, vãrã.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Nu easti vãrã tsi s-aducheascã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">nu easti vãrã om tsi s-caftã Dumnidzãlu.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Tuts s-abatirã dit cali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">tuts deadun s-featsirã anaxii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">nu easti vãrã cai s-facã ghini, vãrã.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Murmintul discljis easti gurmadzlu a lor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">cu limbili a lor au dzãsã arãdeari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">ari fãrmac di nãpãrtitsi sum budzãli a lor.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Gura a lor easti mplinã di blãstem sh-amãrãciuni.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Cicioarili a lor suntu aĝunjisiti tra s-vearsã sãndzi.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Pustuxiri sh-urfanji alasã pri cãljurili a lor,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />sh-calea a paciljei nu u cunuscurã.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Nu easti frica a Dumnidzãlui nãintea a ocljilor a lor.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Ps 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 5:9">5:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:3">140:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:7">10:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:7">Isa 59:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:1">Ps 36:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Noi shtim cã itsido tsi dzãtsi legea, u dzãtsi trã atselji cai suntu sum lege, tsi cathi gurã si s-ncljidã sh-tutã lumea s-hibã sum giudicata al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Trã atsea, vãrã om nu va si ndripteadzã nãintea a lui trã faptili a legiljei, cã prit legea yini mash cunushtearea a amãrtiiljei.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndriptatea Prit Pisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ma tora, cu tutã cã easti sh-legea, easti aspusã ndriptatea a Dumnidzãlui, trã cai mãrtirseashti Legea sh-Prufitsilji, <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />va s-dzãcã ndriptatea al Dumnidzãu prit pistea tu Isus Hristos trã tuts atselji tsi pistipseascã, cã nu ari alidzeari, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />cã tuts au amãrtisit sh-suntu lipsits di mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Tuts suntu ndriptats fãrã-platã prit harul a lui sh-prit arãscumpãrarea tsi easti tu Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Dumnidzãlu lu deadi Hristolu ca curbani di spãstrirea tsi easti loat prit pisti, prit virsarea a sãndzilui a lui. Elu aspusi ndriptatea a lui cã cu arãvdarea. Elu li tricu amãrtiili, cai suntu fapti tu chirolu di ma nãinti. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Dumnidzãlu arãvdã trã aspunearea a ndriptatiljei a lui tu chirolu di tora, tsi elu s-hibã ndreptu shi si ndripteadzã atsel tsi ari pistea tu Isus.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Atumtsea, iu easti pirifanjea? S-astimsi. Prit cai lege? Atsilui a faptilor? Nu, ma prit legea tsi caftã pistea. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Noi minduim cã omlu si ndripteadzã prit pisti fãrã faptili a legiljei. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Vahi nu easti Dumnidzãlu mash Dumnidzãlu a Iudeilor? Nu easti sh-a pãngãnjilor? Ie, easti sh-a pãngãnjilor. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Dumnidzãlu easti un singur. Elu va discãbãteadzã anvãrliga-tãljeatlu prit pistea sh-niananvãrliga-tãljeatlu dit pistea. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Atumtsea, noi u anulãm legea prit pistea? S-hibã diparti! Di contra, u nvãrtushim legea.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abrahamul Ndriptat Prit Pisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Tsi va s-dzãtsem ti atsea tsi aflã Abrahamul, pãrintili a nostru amintat dupã trup? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Cã, macã Abrahamul si ndripte prit faptili, ari cãtse si s-alavdã, ma nu nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Cã tsi dzãtsi Scritura? “Abrahamul lji pistipsi a Dumnãdzãlui sh-aestã lji si lugursi ca ndriptati.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ahr 15:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Atsilui, tsi lucreadzã, plata nu lji si lugurseashti ca har, ma ca datorii. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Iarã atsilui tsi nu lucreadzã, ma pistipseashti tu atsel cai fatsi ndreptu amãrtioslu, pistea a lui lji si lugurseashti ca ndriptati.<verse eid="ROM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Tutashã sh-Davidul hãbãrseashti haraua a omlui a cui Dumnidzãlu lji-u lugurseashti ndriptati fãrã di fapti:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Ca hara di atselji a cui si au ljirtatã amãrtiili</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">sh-a cui si acupirirã amãrtiili.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Ca hara di atsel om</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:8">tsi Dumnidzãlu pute nu va lji-u lugurseascã amãrtia!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Ps 32:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Atumtsea, aestã harauã easti trã anvãrliga-tãljeatslji ama sh-trã nianvãrliga-tãljeatslji? Cã noi dzãtsem: “Al Abraham pistea lji si lugursi ca ndriptati.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ahr 15:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Cum lji si lugursi? Cãndu eara anvãrliga-tãljeat ama cãndu eara nianvãrliga-tãljeat? Nu, cãndu eara tu anvãrliga-tãljeari, ma cãndu eara nianvãrliga-tãljeat. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Sh-Abrahamul lo semnul a anvãrliga-tãljeariljei ca vula a ndriptatiljei prit pistea tsi elu avu cãndu eara nianvãrliga-tãljeat. Ashãtsi elu s-hibã tatãl a tuts pistimenjilor iarã suntu tu nianvãrliga-tãljeari, tsi sh-atsilor s-lã si lugurseascã ndriptatea. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Elu s-featsi tatãl a anvãrliga-tãljeatslor, atsilor tsi nu mash suntu a anvãrliga-tãljeariljei, ma sh-imnã tu urmãli a pistiljei a tatãl a nostru Abraham, tsi elu avu cãndu eara tu nianvãrliga-tãljeari.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Cã tãxirea tsi lji si deadi al Abraham sh-a dupã-yinitorilor a lui, tra s-hibã elu mushtinitor a lumiljei, nu eara prit legea, ma prit ndriptatea cai yini prit pistea. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Cã macã s-facã mushtinitori atselji cai suntu a legiljei, atumtsea pistea easti digeaba sh-tãxirea s-anuleadzã. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Cã legea adutsi inati. Sh-atsia iu nu ari lege, nu easti nitsi ncãlcarea a legiljei. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Trã atsea tãxirea easti prit pistea tra s-hibã prit harul, tsi tãxirea s-hibã sigur trã tuts dupã-yinitorlji, nu mash trã atselji tsi suntu dit lege, ma sh-trã atselji tsi au pistea al Abraham, cai easti tatãl a nostru, a tutulor, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />dupã cum easti scriatã: “Mini ti am arãdãpsitã tatãl a multor natsiuni.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Ahr 17:5</ref>.</char></note> Atsel easti tatãl a nostru nãintea al Dumnidzãu la cai elu pistipsi tsi lji fatsi yii mortsãlji sh-lji acljeamã atseali tsi nu suntu canda va s-eara. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Elu cu nãdii contra cathi nãdii, pistipsi si s-facã elu tatãl a multor fãri, dupã atsea tsi lji si easti dzãsã: “Ashã va hibã dupãyinitura a ta.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Ahr 15:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Sh-cãndu nu lji si minã pistea, elu nu mutri sãnãtatea a truplui a lui, tsi tora eara ca mortu, eara aproapi unã suti di anji, sh-murirea a pãnticlui ali Sari. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Elu nu chiru pistea sh-nu avu shubei tu tãxirea al Dumnidzãu, ma s-nvãrtushi tu pisti dãnda mãriri al Dumnidzãu, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />hinda didip sigur cã tsi Dumnidzãlu ari tãxitã, easti putut s-facã. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Trã atsea, “aestã lji si lugursi ca ndriptati.”<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Tora, nu si scrie mash trã nãsu cã “lji si lugursi,” <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ma sh-trã noi tsi va s-nã si lugurseascã ca atselji tsi pistipsescu tu atsel tsi ari nyeat Isusul, Domnul a nostru dit mortsã. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Elu s-prideadi a moartiljei trã amãrtiili a noastri shi si nyie trã ndriptarea a noastrã.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Pace cu Dumnidzãlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ndriptats prit pisti, avem pace cu Dumnidzãlu prit Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos, <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />prit cai avem intrat cu pisti tu aestu har tu cai stãm sh-noi nã alãvdãm tu nãdia a mãririljei al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Nu mash aestã, ma nã alãvdãm tu munduiri, shtinda cã munduirea adutsi arãvdari, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />arãvdarea haractir, sh-haractirlu nãdii. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Nãdia nu nã arushineadzã, cã vrearea al Dumnidzãu easti virsat tu ininjli a noastri prit Duhlu Sãmtu tsi nã si deadi a noauã.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Cãndu noi ninga earam nipututsi, Hristolu muri tu chirolu tsi prindea trã nidumnidzãsitslji. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Zori easti tra s-moarã vãrã ti un ndreptu, vahi vãrã va cutidza s-murea trã un om bun, <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />ma Dumnidzãlu lu aspusi vrearea a lui trã noi la atsea tsi, cãndu noi ninga earam amãrtioshi, Hristolu muri trã noi.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ahãntu ma multu, hinda ndriptats tora prit sãndzili a lui, va nã ascãpãm di inatea a Dumnidzãlui prit nãsu. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Iarã earam dushmanji, nã puituim cu Dumnidzãlu prit moartea a Hiljilui a lui, tora ninga ma multu tsi him puituits, va nã ascãpãm prit bana a lui. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Nu mash ahãntu, ma sh-nã alãvdãm tu Dumnidzãlu prit Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos, prit cai noi tora avem aprucheat puituirea.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moartea di la Adam sh-Bana Prit Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Trã atsea, ashã dupã cum prit un singur om amãrtia intrã tu lumi, ashãtsi moartea prit amãrtia vini la tuts oaminjlji, cã tuts amãrtisirã, <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />cã, pãnã tu vinita a legiljei, amãrtia eara tu lumi, ma amãrtia nu s-lugursea cã legea nu eara. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Cu tut atsea, moartea domni di la Adam pãnã la Moisiu sh-prit atselji tsi nu avea amãrtisit cum avea amãrtisit Adam, tsi easti icoana atsilui tsi prindi s-yinea. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ghini ma, doara a harului nu easti ca amãrtia, cã macã prit amãrtia a unui om singur murirã multsã oaminji, ahãntu ma multu harul al Dumnidzãu sh-doara prit harul a unui om, Isus Hristos, artirsi trã mults oaminji. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Aestã doarã nu easti ca atsea tsi undzi prit atsel tsi amãrtisi. Cã, di unã parti, giudicata tsi vini di unã cãbati adusi condamna, iarã, di alantã parti, doara a harului tsi vini dupã multi amãrtii adusi ndriptati. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Cã, macã prit amãrtisirea a unui, moartea domni prit atsel, ahãntu ma multu atselji tsi ljea multeatsa a harului sh-a durusiriljei a ndriptatiljei, va domneascã tu banã mash prit un om, Isus Hristos. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Trã atsea, ashãtsi dupã cum mash prit unã amãrtii, bitisita fu condamna pristi tutsã oaminjlji, ashãtsi sh-prit mash unã faptã ndreaptã, bitisita easti ndriptarea tsi da banã trã tuts oaminjlji. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ashãtsi, dupã cum prit niascultarea a unui singur om, multsãlji s-featsirã amãrtioshi, ashãtsi sh-prit ascultarea a unui singur om multsãlji va s-facã ndreptsã. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Tora legea vini tsi s-multseascã ncãlcarea a legiljei, ma atsia iu s-multsã amãrtia, harul artirsi. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Ashãtsi, dupã cum domni amãrtia prit moartea, ashãtsi sh-harul va domneascã prit ndriptatea, tsi adutsi bana di totãna prit Isus Hristos, Domnul a nostru.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Murit tu Amãrtii sh-Nyeat tu Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Trã atsea tsi s-dzãtsem? S-armãnem tu amãrtii tra si multseascã harul? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Pute s-nu hibã! Noi tsi murim di amãrtia, cum va bãnãm ninga cu nãsã? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ma nu shtits cã tuts noi tsi nã pãtidzãm tu Hristolu Isus, nã pãtidzã tu moartea a lui? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Noi, nã ngrupãm deadun cu nãsu prit pãtidzarea tu moarti, tsi, ashãtsi dupã cum s-nyie Isusul dit mortsã prit mãrirea a Tatãlui, ashãtsi sh-noi s-imnãm tu unã noauã banã. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Cã, macã noi him mpriunats cu nãsu tu unã moarti ca a lui, sigur cã va him unã soi sh-tu nyearea a lui. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Noi shtim cã omlu a nostru atsel vecljiul s-crutsisi cu elu, cu nãeti tra s-anuleadzã amãrtia tu trup, tsi noi s-nu him ma sclayi a amãrtiiljei. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Cã atsel tsi muri easti ascãpat di fuchia a amãrtiiljei.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Tora macã murim deadun cu Hristolu, pistipsim cã va s-bãnãm deadun cu elu, <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />shtinda cã Hristolu, metsi s-nyie dit mortsã, nu moari ma, moartea nu u-domneashti ma. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Cã tu atsea tsi muri, muri trã amãrtia unã oarã sh-di totãna, ma tu atsea tsi bãneadzã, bãneadzã trã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ashãtsi sh-voi, lugursits-vã cã di unã parti hits mortsã a amãrtiiljei, ma, di alantã parti hits yii trã Dumnidzãlu tu Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Trã atsea, s-nu domneascã amãrtia tu truplu a vostru muritor, tra s-vã cãndãrsits a orixilor a lui. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Nu aspunets mãdularili a voastri a amãrtiiljei ca hãlãtsili a nindriptatiljei, ma dats-vã a Dumnidzãlui ca yiilji dit mortsã sh-mãdularili a voastri a Dumnidzãlui ca hãlãtsili a ndriptatiljei. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Atumtsea amãrtia nu va vã domneascã, cã nu hits sum lege, ma sum har.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sclayi tu Ndriptati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Atumtsea tsi? S-amãrtisim cã nu him sum lege, ma sum har? Pute s-nu hibã. <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Nu shtits cã cãndu vã spunets a vãrui ca sclayi cãndãrsits, voi hits sclayi atsilui tsi vã cãndãrsits, icã hits sclayi a amãrtiiljei tsi ti adutsi tu moarti, ashãtsi sh-a cãndãrsiriljei tsi ti adutsi tu ndriptati? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ma hãristisim Dumnidzãlu cã fut sclayi a amãrtiiljei, ma ascultat cu tutã inima nvitsãtura la cai vã pridat. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Voi vã liberat di amãrtia sh-vã featsit sclayi a ndriptatiljei. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ma zburãscu ca om trã itia a slãbintsãljei a truplui a vostru. Cã ashã dupã cum aspusitã mãdularili a voastri ca sclayi a nichischineatsiljei sh-a anapudiiljei tsi ti adutsi tu ma multi anapudii, ashã tora aspunets-lã mãdularili a voastri ca sclayi a ndriptatiljei tsi ti dutsi tu sãmtsãri. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Cã, cãndu earats sclayi a amãrtiiljei, earats liberi di ndriptatea.<verse eid="ROM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Tsi buneatsã avets atumtsea di atseali trã cai tora avets arushini? Cã bitisita a lor easti moartea. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ma tora tsi vã liberat di amãrtia sh-vã featsit sclayi a Dumnidzãlui, voi avets carpolu a vostru tsi ti dutsi tu sãmtsiri sh-tu soni tu bana di totãna. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Cã plata a amãrtiiljei easti moartea, ma doara a harului a Dumnidzãlui easti bana eternã tu Hristolu Isus, Domnul a nostru.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Nvitsãturã di Mãrtari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Nu shtits voi frats sh-surãri, (cã ma lã zburãscu atsilor tsi cunoscu legea), cã legea domneashti pri omlu di cãt chiro bãneadzã? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Cã muljearea atsea mãrtata easti ligat prit lege di bãrbatlu a ljei pãnã cãndu elu bãneadzã, ma macã bãrbatlu moari, easti dizligatã di legea a bãrbatlui. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ashãtsi, macã bãrbatlu a ljei bãneadzã sh-ea s-fatsi muljearea a unui altu bãrbat, va si acljeamã curunã-cãlcatã. Ma macã bãrbatlu a ljei moari, ea easti dizligatã di legea sh-poati si s-leagã cu un altu sh-nu si acljeamã curunã-cãlcatã. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ashã, frats sh-surãri a melji, vã featsit s-murits di legea prit truplu a Hristolui, tra s-hits a unui altu, atsilui tsi s-nyie dit mortsã, cu nãeti tsi s-dãm carpo trã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Cã, cãndu earam tu trup, pasiunili amãrtioasi tsi s-inimusea prit legea, lucra tu mãdularili a noastri trã dari carpolu a moartiljei. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ashãtsi tora, noi nã dizligãm di legea, murinda dit atsel cai nã tsinea ligats, sh-ashã noi s-huzmitipsim tu bana atsea noauã a Duhlui sh-nu dupã veacljea literã scriatã.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Legea sh-Amãrtia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Tsi s-dzãtsem tora? Legea easti amãrtii? Pute s-nu hibã! Di contra, amãrtia nu u cunuscui dicãt, mash prit legea. Dealihea, zilia nu va u cunushteam macã legea s-nu nji dzãtsea: “S-nu ai zilii!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Ex 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Deut 5:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ma amãrtia, avãnda itii di la aestu ordin nyie tu mini tuti ziliili, cã fãrã di lege amãrtia easti moartã. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Vãrãoarã mini bãnam fãrã di lege, ma iarã vini ordinlu, amãrtia s-nyie di nou <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />sh-mini murii sh-ordinlu tsi s-deadi ti banã, dealihea adusi moarti trã mini. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Cã amãrtia, aflãnda itii prit ordinlu, mi arãsi sh-prit nãsu mi vãtãmã. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ashãtsi cã, legea dealihea easti sãmtã sh-ordinlu easti sãmtu, ndreptu sh-bunu.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Atumtsea, atsea tsi easti bunã trã mini s-featsi moarti? Pute s-nu hibã! Ma amãrtia, tra si aspunã amãrtii adusi trã mini moartea prit buna, cu nãeti tsi amãrtia si s-fãtsea multã amãrtioasã prit ordinlu. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ashãtsi noi shtim cã legea easti duhuroasã. Iarã mini escu di carni, vindut a amãrtiiljei ca sclav. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Cã mini nu u aduchescu atsea tsi fac. Atsea tsi voi, nu u fac, iarã atsea tsi u aurãscu, u fac. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ma, macã fac atsea tsi nu voi, aspun deadun cu legea cã ea easti bunã. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ma tora nu escu ma mini tsi adar atsea, ma amãrtia tsi bãneadzã tu mini. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Cã shtiu cã tu mini, va s-dzãcã tu truplu a meu, nu bãneadzã tsiva bunã, cã cu tutã cã voljea easti tu mini, nu pot s-adar bunlu. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Cã, bunlu tsi voi, nu lu fac, iarã arãulu tsi nu lu voi, atsel lu fac. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Tora, macã fac atsea tsi nu u voi, nu escu ma mini atsel tsi u-fac, ma amãrtia cai bãneadzã tu mini.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Ashãtsi, voi s-fac unã buneatsã, ma mini aflã aestã lege: tu mini easti arãulu. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Cã mini mi puituescu cu harauã cu legea al Dumnidzãu tu omlu di nãuntru, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />ma ved unã altã lege tu mãdularili a meali, tsi alumtã contra a legiljei a mintiljei a mea sh-mi fatsi un hãpsãnit tu legea a amãrtiiljei, tsi easti tu mãdularili a meali. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Cãtã om corbu escu mini! Cai va mi ascapã di truplu a moartiljei aishtei? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />S-hibã hãristisitã Dumnidzãlu prit Isus Hristolu, Domnul a nostru! Ashãtsi, mini idyiul, di unã parti cu minti lji huzmitipsescu a legiljei al Dumnidzãu, ma di alantã parti cu trup lji huzmitipsescu a legiljei a amãrtiiljei.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Banã Noauã Prit Duhlu Sãmtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Trã atsea, tora nu ari vãrã condamnã trã atselji cai suntu tu Hristolu Isus, <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />cã legea a Duhlui cai da banã tu Hristolu Isus, nã ascãpã di legea a amãrtiiljei sh-a moartiljei. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Cã, tsi eara niputut trã legea, tu atsea tsi eara slab trã itia a truplui, Dumnidzãlu pitricu Hiljiu a lui tu undzearea a truplui amãrtios tra s-hibã amãrtii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Icã “amãrtii curbãnsitã”. </char></note> sh-ashã elu condamnã amãrtia tu trup, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />tsi ndriptatea a legiljei si mplineascã tu noi cai nu imnãm dupã trup, ma dupã Duh.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Cã atselji tsi imnã dupã trup, au mintea la orixili a truplui, iarã atselji tsi imnã tu Duh, au mintea la atseali tsi va Duhlu. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Cã, minduirea domnuit di truplu ti dutsi tu moarti, iarã minduirea domnuit di Duhlu ti dutsi tu banã sh-pace, <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />cã minduirea a truplui easti dushmãnilji cãtrã Dumnidzãlu, cã nu lji easti sumbãgat a legiljei al Dumnidzãu sh-nitsi nu poati. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Atselji tsi bãneadzã dupã trup, nu pot s-lji arseascã al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Voi nu bãnats dupã trup, ma tu Duh macã dealihea Duhlu al Dumnidzãu bãneadzã tu voi. Macã vãrã nu ari Duhlu al Hristos, elu nu easti a Hristolui. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ma macã Hristolu easti tu voi, truplu easti mortu trã itia a amãrtiiljei, ma Duhlu nã da banã trã itia a ndriptatiljei. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Macã Duhlu atsilui tsi nyie Isusul dit mortsã bãneadzã tu voi, atsel tsi nyie dit mortsã Hristolu va facã yii sh-trupurili a voastri muritoari prit Duhlu a lui tsi bãneadzã tu voi.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Atumtsea, frats sh-surãri, noi him mprumuts nu cãtrã truplu tra s-bãnãm dupã trup, <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />cã, macã bãnats dupã trup, va murits, ma macã prit Duhlu lã fãtsets s-moarã faptili a truplui, va bãnats. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Cã tuts atselji cai suntu cãlãuzits di Duhlu al Dumnidzãu, aeshti suntu hiljilji al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Voi nu loat duhlu a sclãviiljei tra s-avets nãpoi fricã, ma loat Duhlu a nhiljeariljei prit cai grim: “Abba, Tate!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Idyiul Duh mãrtirseashti deadun cu duhlu a nostru cã him cilimenjlji al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Sh-macã him cilimenji, him sh-mushtinitori, mushtinitori al Dumnidzãu sh-mushtinitori deadun cu Hristolu, macã di-alihea nã munduim cu nãsu tsi shi s-nã mãrim cu nãsu.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munduirili di Tora sh-Mãrirea tsi Yini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Mini minduescu cã munduirili di tora, nu axizescu s-misurã cu mãrirea tsi easti etimu s-nã si discoapirã. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Cã vrearea atsea marea a fãpturiljei, ashteaptã cu niarãvdari discupirirea a hiljilor al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Cã fãptura s-i sumbãgã a lucrilor digeaba, nu cu vrearea a ljei, ma trã itia a Dumnidzãlui tsi u sumbãgã, cu nãdii <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />cã sh-idyia fãptura va s-ascapã di sclãvia a aspãrdzeariljei trã intrari tu libertatea sh-mãrirea a cilimenjilor a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Noi u shtim cã tutã fãptura suschirã deadun sh-ari durearili a amintariljei pãnã tu chirolu di tora. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Nu mash ea, ma sh-noi idyilji, cai avem protlu frut a Duhlui, suschirãm tu noi, ashtiptãnda cu niarãvdari nhiljearea sh-arãscumpãrarea a truplui a nostru. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Cã prit nãdii nã ascãpãm, ma nãdia cai s-veadi, nu easti nãdii, cã cai nãdãeashti la atsea tsi veadi? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ma, macã nãdãim la atsea tsi nu u videm, atumtsea u ashtiptãm cu arãvdari. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Tutashã sh-Duhlu nã agiuti tu slãbintsa a noastrã, cã noi nu shtim trã tsi s-nã rugãm ashã cum prindi, ma idyiul Duhlu s-roagã trã noi cu suschirãri ni-spusi. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ma, atsel tsi sitãxeashti ininjli shtii cai easti minduirea a Duhlui, cã anamiseashti dupã vrearea al Dumnidzãu trã sãmtsãlji.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma Multu Dicãt Nichisits</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Sh-noi shtim cã Dumnidzãlu lã fatsi tuti lucrili s-lucreadzã ti ghinea atsilor tsi va elu sh-suntu acljimats dupã nãetea a lui. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Cã atselji tsi Dumnidzãlu lji cunuscu di ma nãinti, sh-lji aleapsi di ma nãinti s-hibã unã soi cu icoana a Hiljilui a lui, ashãtsi elu s-hibã atsel protlu-amintat ntrã multsã frats sh-surãri. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Sh-atselji tsi lji aleapsi di ma nãinti sh-lji acljimã, sh-atselji tsi lji acljimã lji ndriptã, sh-atselji tsi lji ndriptã sh-lji multumãri. <verse eid="ROM 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Tsi s-dzãtsem trã aesti lucri? Macã Dumnidzãlu easti cu noi, cai poati s-hibã contra noi? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Dumnidzãlu, tsi nu lu tsãnu Hiljiu a lui, ma lu prideadi ti noi tuts, cum nu va nã li da deadun cu nãsu tuti lucrili? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Cai va lji acuzeadzã aleptsilji al Dumnidzãu? Dumnidzãlu easti atsel cai lji ndripteadzã. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Cai easti atsel tsi lji-condamnã? Hristolu Isus easti atsel tsi muri, meti atsel tsi si nyie shi sheadi tu nandreapta a Dumnidzãlui sh-easti misit ti noi. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Cai va nã dispartã noi di vrearea a Hristolui? Munduirea, strimtura, priaĝunirea, foamea, dizvishtearea, piricljiu icã spata? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ashãtsi cum easti scriatã: “Trã itia a voastrã noi ma nã dutsem tu moarti dzua tutã, nã lugursim ca oi trã tãljeari.” <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ma, tu tuti aesti lucri noi him multu nichisitori prit atsel cai nã vru. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Cã escu cãndãrsit cã, nitsi moartea, nitsi bana, nitsi anghilji, nitsi demonjlji, nitsi atseali di tora, nitsi atseali tsi va yinã, nitsi fuchiili, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />nitsi anãltsimea, nitsi ahãndamea, nitsi vãrã tsiva altã adratã, nu va poatã s-nã dispartã di vrearea a Dumnidzãlui, tsi easti tu Hristolu Isus, Domnul a nostru.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Apofãsirea Suvranã al Dumnidzãu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ma dzãc alihea tu Hristos, nu arãd, (vahi mãrtirseashti deadun cu mini conshtintsa a mea tu Duhlu Sãmtu), <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />cã mini am mari jali sh-un dureari nicurmatã tu inima a mea. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Cã va vream s-earam mini idyiul blãstimat, dispãrtsãt di Hristolu, trã hãtãrea a popului a meu, a farãljei a mea dupã trup, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />cai suntu Israelits. A lor easti nhiljearea, mãrirea, pisti-ligãturili, dimãndarea a legiljei, ncljinarea tu templu sh-tãxirili, <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />di cai suntu patriarhilji sh-di la cai vini Hristolu dupã trup, atsel cai easti pristi tuti sh-Dumnidzã ghinicuvintat di totãna. Amin.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ma aestã nu va s-dzãcã cã ari cãdzut nghios zborlu al Dumnidzãu, cã nu tuts atselji cai suntu di Israel suntu tamam Israelits, <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />sh-nu cã suntu dupãyinitura al Abraham, suntu tuts cilimenji a lui, di contra: “Tu Isac va s-acljeamã dupãyinitura a ta.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Aestã va s-dzãcã cã, nu suntu cilimenji a truplui aeshti cilimenji al Dumnidzãu, ma cilimenji a tãxiriljei cai s-lugursescu ca dupãyinitura al Abraham. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Cã zborlu a tãxiriljei easti aestã: “Tu chirolu aestu va yin sh-Sara va aibã un ficior.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Sh-nu mash aestã, ma sh-Rebeca armasi greauã di la bãrbatlu, di Isaclu pãrintili a nostru, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />cã ninga niamintat dzeaminjlji sh-ni faptã tsiva bunã icã tsiva arãu tra s-armãnea nãetea al Dumnidzãu dupã alidzearea: <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />nu prit faptili, ma prit atsel cai vã acljeamã, lji si dzãsi a ljei: “Ma marili va lji huzmitipseascã a ma njiclui,” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />ashã di cum easti scriatã: “Iacovlu lu vrui, iarã Esaul lu aurãi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Tsi s-dzãtsem? Nacã ari nindriptati la Dumnidzãlu? Pute s-nu hibã! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Cã elu lj-dzãtsi al Moisiu: “Va s-am njilã trã caitsido tsi s-njiluescu sh-va s-am dor, trã caitsido tsi s-aspun dor.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ashãtsi cã, nu si spindzurã di vrearea a omlui sh-nitsi di atsel tsi alagã, ma si spindzurã di Dumnidzãlu cai njilueashti. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Cã Scritura lji dzãtsi al Faraon: “Tamam trã aestã ti anãltsai, cu nãeti tra s-aspuneam la tini putearea a mea sh-cu nãeti tsi s-dimãndã numa a mea prit tutã loclu.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Trã atsea Dumnidzãlu atsel tsi va, lu njilueashti, sh-atsel tsi va, lu nchitreashti.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Atumtsea tini va nji dzãts: “Cãtse Dumnidzãlu ninga nã fatsi cu cãbati? Cai poati s-lji ncuntreadzã a vreariljei a lui? <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ma cai eshti tini, lai om, tsi lj-cundreshti al Dumnidzãu? Nacã vahi va lj-dzãcã vaslu atsilui tsi lu adrã: ‘Cãtse mi adrash ashãtsi?’ ” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Nacã nu ari puteari pucearlu pri muzgã trã fãtseari dit idyia frimintãturã un vas ti tinjii sh-alantu vas di cathi dzuã? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ma tsi easti aestã macã Dumnidzãlu, vrãnda si aspunã inatea a lui shi s-facã cunuscutã putearea a lui, tsãnu cu multã arãvdari vasili a inatiljei a lui, tsi eara itimãsiti ti aspãrdzeari, <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />sh-cu nãeti s-fac cunuscut avearea a mãririljei a lui pristi vasili a njililjei tsi li itimãsi di ma nãinti ti mãriri? <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ashãtsi noi nã acljimã, nu mash di la Iudeilji, ma sh-di la fãrili. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ashãtsi di cum dzãtsi la Hosea:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:25" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Atselji tsi nu eara populu a meu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">va lu acljem ‘populu a meu’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">sh-atsea cai nu eara vrutã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">va u acljem ‘vrutã’. ”<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Sh-va si s-facã cã, tu loclu iu lã si dzãsi a lor:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“ ‘Nu hits populu a meu’,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">aclo elji va si acljeamã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‘hilji al Dumnidzãu atsel yiulu’.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Iarã Isaia greashti ti Israelu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Sh-ma s-hibã numirlu a hiljilor al Israel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">ca arina a amariljei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">mash armãsãturili va si ascapã,<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />cã Domnul va facã tsi zborlu a lui pri loc</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">si s-facã mplinã sh-trãoarã.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Sh-ashã cum ari pridzãsã Isaia:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:29" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Macã Domnul Tutãputut</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">s-nu nã alãsa dupãyinitura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">ca Sodom va earam faptã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">sh-ca Gomora va undzeam.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Nipistipsirea al Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Tsi s-dzãtsem atumtsea? Cã pãngãnjlji cai nu urmeadzã ndriptatea, u agiumsirã ndriptatea, meti ndriptatea tsi easti dit pistea, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />iarã Israelu urmãnda legea a ndriptatiljei, nu u agiumsi. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Cãtse? Cã nu cãftarã s-u agiundzea prit pisti, ma di cum s-eara prit faptili. Elji s-nchidicarã di cheatra a nchidicariljei, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />ashãtsi di cum easti scriatã: “Ia, ma bagã tu Sion unã cheatrã di nchidicari sh-un shcãmbã trã cãdeari, sh-atsel tsi pistipseashti la nãsu nu va si arushineadzã.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Frats sh-surãri, vrearea a inimãljei a mea sh-rugãciunea trã Dumnidzãlu easti tsi Israelitslji s-ascapã. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Cã mini pot s-mãrtirsescu trã elji cã au zel trã Dumnidzãlu, ma nu dupã unã cunushteari ndreaptã. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Cã nicunuscãnda ndriptatea al Dumnidzãu sh-cãftãnda s-bagã ndriptatea a lor, nu si sumbãgarã a ndriptatiljei al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Cã bitisita a legiljei easti Hristolu, tra s-hibã ndriptatea di cathiunu cai pistipseashti.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ascãparea Trã Tuts</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Moisiu ari scriat aestã ti ndriptatea cai easti dit Legea: “Omlu cai li fatsi atseali lucri va bãneadzã prit eali.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Iarã ndriptatea cai yini prit pistea dzãtsi ashãtsi: S-nu dzãts tu inima a ta: “Cai va s-alinã tu tser?” (Tsi va s-dzãcã trã dipunari Hristolu), <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />icã: “Cai va dipunã tu ahãndami?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ahãndami, abis, loclu nghios a mortsãlor.</char></note> (Va s-dzãcã, trã sculari Hristolu nsus dit mortsã). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ma tsi s-dzãtsi? “Aproapi di tini easti zborlu, tu gura a ta sh-tu inima a ta” (va s-dzãcã, zborlu a pistiljei cai noi predicãm). <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Cã, macã mãrtirseshti cu gura a ta, cã Isusul easti Domnu sh-ma s-pistipseshti cu inima a ta cã Dumnidzãlu lu nyie atsel dit mortsã, va ti ascachi. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Cã, cu inima omlu pistipseashti shi s-fatsi ndreptu, iarã cu gura mãrtirseashti sh-va s-ascapã. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Cã Scritura dzãtsi: “Caitsido tsi pistipseashti tu nãsu (Hristolu), nu va si arushineadzã.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Cã nu ari alidzeari namisa di Iudeilji sh-di Pãngãnjlji, cã idyiul Domnu easti Domnul a tutulor, tsi ghinicuvãnteadzã cu artirsiri tuts atselji cai lu acljeamã, <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />cã: “Caitsido tsi va acljeamã numa a Domnului, va ascapã.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Atumtsea, cum va s-acljeamã atsel cai nu l-pistipsirã? Sh-cum s-pistipseascã atsel tsi nu u avdzãrã? Sh-cum s-avdã macã nu easti vãrã s-lã preadicã a lor? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Sh-cum s-preadicã, macã nu suntu pitricuts? Ashãtsi di cum easti scriat: “Cãti mushati suntu cicioarili atsilor cai dimãndu hãbarea atsea buna!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ma nu tuts ascultarã hãbarea atsea buna, cã Isaia dzãtsi: “Doamne, cai lji pistipsi a hãbariljei a noastrã?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Ashãtsi pistea yini prit avdzãrea sh-avdzãrea yini prit zborlu al Hristos.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ma mini vã ntreb: Nacã nu avdzãrã!? Fãrã di altã cã avdzãrã. “Tu tutã loclu ishi boatsea a lor, sh-tu mãrdzinjili a lumiljei s-avdzãrã zboarili a lor.” <verse eid="ROM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Ma mini vã ntreb: “Nacã Israelu nu aduchi tsiva?” Protlu Moisiu dzãsi: “Mini va s-vã fac s-avets zilii trã un natsiuni cai nu easti natsiuni, trã un natsiuni cai nu poati s-aducheascã sh-va vã facã s-vã inãtusits.” <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Sh-Isaia cu curaiu dzãtsi: “Mi aflai di atselji tsi nu mi cãftarã. Mi feciu vidzut atsilor cai nu ntreab ti mini.” <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ma cãtrã Israel dzãtsi: “Tutã dzua li am teasã mãnjili a meali cãtrã un popul tsi easti nicãndãrsit sh-rebil.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Armãsãtura dit Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Mini ntreb: Nacã Dumnidzãlu alipidã populu a lui? Pute s-nu hibã! Cã sh-mini escu Israelit dit fara al Abraham sh-dit soia al Beniamin. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Dumnidzãlu nu alipidã populu a lui, cai lu cunuscu di ma nãinti. Nu shtits tsi dzãtsi Scritura trã Elia cãndu s-plãndzi a Dumnidzãlui contra a Israelui? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Doamne, prufitsilji a tãlji lji vãtãmarã sh-altarili a tali li asparsirã sh-mini armash singur sh-elji ma caftu bana a mea!” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ma tsi lji apãndisi Dumnidzãlu a lui? “Alãsai trã mini shapti njilji di bãrbats cai nu si dzinucljiarã al Baal.”<verse eid="ROM 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ashã sh-tu chirolu di tora ari armasã putsãnã dupã alidzearea prit har. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Sh-macã easti prit har, nu easti ma prit fapti, altã soi harul nu va eara har. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Tsi atumtsea? Atsea tsi Israelu u cãfta, nu u agiumsi, ma aleptsilji u agiumsirã, iarã alantsãlji s-nchitrirã, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />ashã cum easti scriatã: “Dumnidzãlu lã deadi a lor un duh di amurtsãri, oclji tra s-nu veadã, sh-ureclji tra s-nu avdã, pãnã tu dzua di azã.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Sh-Davidul dzãtsi: “Measa a lor si s-facã cearcu, lats, nchidicari sh-un arãsplãtiri trã nãshi. <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Ocljilji a lor si scutidiseascã tra s-nu veadã shi plãtãrili a lor s-hibã nduplicati di totãna.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dedzili Ambuljisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Trã atsea ntreb: Nacã s-nchidicarã, trã cãdeari? Pute s-nu hibã! Ma prit cãdearea a lor, lã vini ascãparea a pãngãnjilor tra si zilipseascã Israelitslji. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Tora, macã cãdearea a lor easti aveari trã lumea sh-chirearea a lor easti aveari trã pãngãnjlji, cãt ma multu va hibã mplinãtatea a lor!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Tora ma vã dzãc a voauã, a pãngãnjilor, cã pãn-cãt mini escu apostul a pãngãnjilor, u alavdu huzmitipsirea a mea, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />cu nãdii s-facã zilichear atselji cai suntu fara a mea shi s-ascapã niscãntsã di elji. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Cã macã arnipsirea a lor adusi puituirea a lumiljei, tsi va hibã apruchearea a lor, nafoarã dicãt banã dit mortsã!? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Sh-macã pãna di prota cai lji si da a Dumnidzãlui easti sãmtã, atumtsea tut aloatlu easti sãmtã, sh-macã arãdãtsina easti sãmtã, sh-dedzili suntu sãmti.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Tora, macã niscãnti dedzi s-arupsirã sh-tini hinda agru-masini, ti ambuljisish tu eali sh-ti fãtsesh pãrtash cu arãdãtsinili, va s-dzãcã cu grãsimea a masnilui. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Trã atsea, nu ti alavdã contra a dedzilor, cã macã ti alavdzã contra a lor, adu aminti cã nu u tsãnji tini arãdãtsina ma arãdãtsina ti tsãni tini. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Tini va dzãts atumtsea: “Dedzili s-arupsirã tra s-mi ambuljisescu mini.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ghini! Atseali s-arupsirã trã itia a nipistiljei, iarã tini stai trã itia a pistiljei. Nu ti pirifãnsea, ma s-ai fricã. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Macã Dumnidzãlu nu li njilui dedzili naturali, nu va ti njilueascã sh-tini. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Trã atsea vedz bunãtatea sh-asprimea al Dumnidzãu, di unã parti, asprimea cãtrã atselji cai cãdzurã, di alantã parti bunãtatea al Dumnidzãu cãtrã tini, ma s-armãnji tu bunãtatea a lui, altã soi sh-tini va ti talji. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ma sh-elji, macã nu va armãnã tu nipistipsiri, va s-hibã ambuljisits, cã Dumnidzãlu easti putut s-lji ambuljiseascã nãpoi. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Cã, macã tini ti tãljeash di atsel tsi di natura easti agru-masini sh-ti ambuljisish contra a naturãljei tu imir-masini, ahãntu ma multu aeshti cai suntu dedzi di natura, va si ambuljiseascã tu masnili a lor.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tut Israelu Va Ascapã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Cã, nu voi frats sh-surãri, tsi voi s-hits nishtiuts ti aestu mistiryiu tra s-nu vã tsãnets ca mintimenji: cã tu unã parti di Israel s-fatsi unã nchitriri, pãnã cãndu s-aibã intratã mplinãtatea a pãngãnjilor. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Sh-ashãtsi tut Israelu va s-ascapã. Cum easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Ascãpãtorlu va yinã dit Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">elu va dipãrteadzã nidumnidzisirea di la Iacovu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Sh-aestã easti pisti-ligãtura a mea cu elji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">cãndu mini s-mut amãrtiili a lor.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Di unã parti, cãndu easti zborlu di evanghelu elji suntu dushmanji trã hãtãrea a voastrã, ma cãndu easti zborlu di alidzeari, elji suntu vruts trã hãtãrea a pãrintsãlor. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Cã doarili sh-acljimarea a Dumnidzãlui suntu niturnati. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ashã di cum voi ma nãinti nu avets ascultat Dumnidzãlu, ma tora vã njiluit trã itia a niascultariljei a lor, <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />ashãtsi sh-aeshti tora nu ascultarã, cu nãeti tsi, trã itia a njiluiriljei cãtrã voi, sh-elji s-hibã njiluits. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Cã Dumnidzãlu lji ncljisi tuts tu niascultari, cu nãeti tsi s-lji njilueascã tuts.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Himnul a Alãvdariljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />O ahãndami a aveariljei, a frunimeatsiljei sh-a shtiriljei al Dumnidzãu! Cãt di nipitrumti suntu giudicãtsili a lui sh-cãt di niurmãsiti suntu cãljurili a lui. <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Cã cai u cunuscu mintea a Domnului? Icã cai s-featsi urnipsitorlu a lui? <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Cai lji deadi ma nãinti a lui sh-Dumnidzãlu s-lji da arãsplata? <verse eid="ROM 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Cã di la nãsu sh-prit nãsu, sh-trã nãsu suntu tuti. A lui s-lji hibã mãrirea tu eta a etilor! Amin!<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Curbãnsiri Yii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Trã atsea, ma vã urnipsescu, frats sh-surãri, prit njila a Dumnidzãlui, tra s-pãrãstãsits trupurili a voastri ca curbani yii, sãmtsã, arsitã di Dumnidzãlu tsi easti huzmitipsirea a voastrã mintimenã. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Sh-nu vã uidisits cu aestã lumi, ma alãxits-vã prit rinoirea a mintiljei, tra s-cunushtets cai easti voljea atsea buna, arsitã sh-perfectã al Dumnidzãu.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Huzmitipsirea tu Truplu a Hristolui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Cã prit harul tsi nji si deadi, lji dzãc a cathiunui cai easti ntrã voi tsi s-nu aibã minduiri ma analtã dicãt prindi trã nãsu, ma s-mindueascã cã cum s-hibã misurat, ashã di cum Dumnidzãlu lji deadi a cathiunui misura a pistiljei. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Cã, dupã cum tu un trup avem multi mãdulari, ma nu au tuti idyiul lucru, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />ashãtsi sh-noi multsãlji him un trup tu Hristolu sh-cathiunu him mãdulari tu un-alantu. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Noi avem doari soi di soi, dupã harul tsi nã si deadi. Atsel tsi ari prufitsia, s-prufitipseascã dupã misurã a pistiljei tsi ari. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Atsel tsi ari diaconia, s-huzmitipseascã, atsel tsi ari nvitsãtura s-nveatsã, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />atsel tsi da curaiu, s-hibã trã dari curaiu, atsel tsi duruseashti, s-duruseascã cu inimã discljisã, atsel tsi cumãndãseashti, s-cumãndãseascã cu zel, atsel tsi fatsi lucri di njilã si l-facã cu harauã.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vrearea tu Fapti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Vrearea s-hibã fãrã ipucrizii. Aurãts arãulu sh-alãchits-vã dinãpoi a ghiniljei. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />S-hits vruts cu un-alantu cu vreari frãtseascã, tinjisits-lu alantu ma multu di cãt ti tinjiseshti tini. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />S-nu hits timbelji tu zel, s-hits nfocats tu duh sh-huzmitipsits a Domnului. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Hãrsits-vã tu nãdii, arãvdats tu munduiri, s-hits ipiminisits tu rugãciunji. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Agiutats tu ananghili a oaminjlor a Dumnidzãlui, urmats ghini-ashtiptarea.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Ghinicuvintats atselji tsi vã priaĝunescu, ghinicuvintats sh-nu blãstimats! <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Hãrsits-vã cu atselji tsi hãrsescu, sh-plãndzets cu atselji tsi plãngu. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Minduits idyiul lucru trã un-alantu, s-nu vã creascã mintea ma sotsãsits-vã cu aplicatslji. Nu vã lugursits ca mintimenji. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Nu lji turnats a vãrui arãulu cu arãu, aspunets cãshtiga trã tsi easti ghini nãintea a oaminjlor tuts. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Macã easti putut, trã tsi easti spindzurat di voi, bãnats tu pace cu caitsido. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Nu vã arãzbunats vruts, ma dats loc a inatiljei a Dumnidzãlui, cã easti scriatã: “A mea easti arãzbunarea, mini va arãsplãtescu,” dzãtsi Domnul. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Trã atsea ma ghini:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 12:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">“Macã ari foami dushmanlu a tãu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">dã-lji s-mãcã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">macã ari seati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">dã-lji s-bea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">cã fãcãnda aestã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">va adunji cãrbunji di foc pri caplu a lui.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Nu ti azvindzi di arãulu, ma nichisea pristi arãulu cu buna.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Sumbãgarea di Autoritãtsili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Cathi om s-hibã sumbãgat la autoritãtsili di chivernisi, cã nu ari autoritati dicãt mash di la Dumnidzãlu, sh-atseali tsi suntu di la Dumnidzãlu suntu arãdãpsiti. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Trã atsea atsel tsi ncuntreadzã autoritãtsili, ncuntreadzã ordinli a Dumnidzãlui, sh-atselji tsi s-ncuntreadzã va ljea pri nãshi condamna. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Cã domnjilji nu ai cãtse s-lji ai fricã trã fapti buni, ma trã fapti arali. Vrei s-nu ai fricã di autoritatea? Fã ghini sh-va s-ai alãvdari di la ea. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ea easti huzmichearã al Dumnidzãu trã ghinea a ta, ghini ma, ma s-fatsã arãu, aspari-ti cã ea nu u-tsãni vãnat spata. Chivernisea easti huzmichear al Dumnidzãu, arãzgãnãtor tsi adutsi condamã cãtrã atsel tsi fatsi arãu. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Trã atsea, easti di ananghi s-vã sumbãgats, nu mash trã itia a condamnariljei, ma sh-trã itia a conshtintsãljei.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Cã, di aestã voi plãtits sh-taxili, cã autoritãtsili suntu huzmicheari al Dumnidzãu fãcãnda dipriunã aestã huzmitipsiri. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Dats-lã a tutulor atsea tsi lã hriuisits: atsilui tsi lji hriusits taxa, taxa, atsilui tsi lji hriusits vamã, vamã, atsilui tsi lji hriusits frica, frica, atsilui tsi lji hriusits tinjia, tinjia.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vrearea Mplineashti Legea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />A vãrui s-nu lji avets mprumut, di cãt s-vã vrets cu un-alantu, cã atsel tsi va alantu, u-ari mplinit legea. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Cã dimãndãciunjili: “S-nu caltsã curuna, s-nu vatsãnji, s-nu furii, s-nu ai zilii,” sh-macã ari vãrã altã ordin, s-dzãtsi cu un zbor: “S-vrei aproapilu a tãu ashãtsi di cum ti vrei tini!” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Vrearea nu lji fatsi arãu a aproapilui, trã atsea mplinirea a legiljei easti vrearea.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Sh-aestã fãtsets-u shtinda chirolu, cã tora easti oara s-vã dishtiptats dit somnu, cã tora ascãparea a noastrã easti ma aproapi dicãt atumtsea cãndu pistipsim. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Noaptea s-dusi sh-dzua s-apruche. S-arcãm nclo faptili a scutidlui shi s-nvishtem armili a lunjinãljei. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />S-imnãm cu tinjii ca tu chirolu a dzuãljei, nu tu chehi sh-tu mbitãri, nu tu putãnlichi sh-tu disfãrnari, nu tu ngrãnji sh-tu nchizmã. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ashãtsi nvishtets-vã tu Domnul Isus Hristos sh-nu vã bãgats tu mirachi ti truplu tra s-lji mplinits orixili.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">S-Avets Cãshtigã Ti Atselji Slaghi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Tora aprucheats-lu atsel tsi easti slabu tu pisti sh-ni vãrghit minduirili a lui. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Vãrã pistipseashti cã prindi s-mãcã di tuti, iarã atsel tsi easti slabu mãcã mash zãrzãvãtsi. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Atsel tsi mãcã itsido, s-nu dispretsueascã atsel tsi nu mãcã sh-atsel tsi nu mãcã di tuti, s-nu giudicã atsel tsi mãcã di tuti, cã Dumnidzãlu lu apruche atsel. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Cai eshti tini tsi giudits huzmichearlu a altului? Elu sta pri cicioari icã cadi, aestã easti lucrul a nicuchirlui a lui, ma elu va sta ndreptu, cã Dumnidzãlu easti putut s-lu facã si sta pri cicioari. <verse eid="ROM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Unlu tinjiseashti unã dzuã ma multã di unã altã, alantu li tinjiseashti tuti dzãlili unã soi. Cathiun s-hibã didip sigur tu mintea a lui. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Atsel tsi tinjiseashti dzua, trã Domnul u tinjiseashti sh-atsel tsi mãcã, trã Domnul mãcã cã elu hãristiseashti Dumnidzãlu. Atsel tsi nu mãcã, trã Domnul nu mãcã sh-hãristiseashti Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Cã vãrã di noi nu bãneadzã trã nãsu sh-vãrã nu moari trã nãsu. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Macã bãnãm, trã Domnul bãnãm, sh-macã murim, trã Domnul murim. Ashãtsi, macã bãnãm sh-macã murim, a Domnului him. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Trã aestã muri Hristolu, s-nyie shi s-turnã tu banã, tra s-domneascã sh-pristi mortsãlji sh-pristi yiilji.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Ma tini cãtse giudits fratili a tãu? Tini alantu, cãtse dispretsueshti fratili a tãu? Cã tuts va stãm nãintea a thronlui a giudicatãljei al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Cã easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“‘Mi giurã trã bana a mea,’ dzãtsi Domnul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">‘cã nãintea a mea va si apleacã cathi dzinucljiu, sh-cathi limbã va s-alavdã Dumnidzãlu.’”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Trã atsea, cathiun di noi va lji da lugurii a Dumnidzãlui trã nãsu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Trã atsea, s-nu nã giudicãm cu un-alantu, ma ma ghini minduits aestã, s-nu bãgats ncheadic shi s-cadã tu amãrtii fratili a tãu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mini shtiu sh-escu cãndãrsit tu Domnul Isus, cã tsiva nu easti nicurat. Ma trã atsel tsi lugurseashti cã easti vãrã tsiva nicurat, atumtsea trã atsel easti nicurat. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Cã, macã trã itia a mãcariljei fratili icã sora a ta suntu nvirinats, tini nu ma imnji ma dupã vrearea. Nu u-cheari cu mãcarea a ta fratili icã sora trã cai Hristolu muri. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Trã atsea s-nu si ngiurã buneatsa a voastrã. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Cã amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu nu easti mãcari sh-beari, ma ndriptati, pace sh-harauã tu Duhlu Sãmtu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Atsel tsi lji huzmitipseashti a Hristolui tu aestã, easti arsitã di la Dumnidzãlu sh-aprovat di la oaminjlji.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Atumtsea s-urmãm atseali tsi suntu trã pace sh-trã nvãrtushirea a unui-alantu. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Nu aspardzi lucrul a Dumnidzãlui trã mãcari! Dealihea tutã mãcarea easti curatã, ma easti arãu trã omlu tsi mãcã tsiva tsi-lji si-fatsi ncheadic a altului. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ghini easti s-nu mãtsi carni shi s-nu beai yin shi s-nu fatsi tsiva altã la cai fratili shi sora a ta si s-ncheadicã shi s-cadã. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Pistea tsi ai, s-u ai trã tini nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. Cahara di atsel tsi nu si giudicã singur prit atseali tsi aleadzi. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ma atsel tsi ãndoiashti, ma s-mãcã, easti condamnat, cã mãcarea a lui nu easti dit pistea, sh-itsido tsi nu easti dit pistea easti amãrtii.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Hristolu Modelu a Nostru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Noi tsi him vãrtoshi prindi s-purtãm slãbintsa atsilor cai suntu slaghi shi s-nu cãftãm chefea a noastrã. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Cathiun di noi s-lji arseascã a aproapilui trã ghinea sh-nãintarea a lui. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Cã sh-Hristolu nu cãftã arsirea a lui, ma ashã cum easti scriatã: “Ngiurãrili atsilor tsi ti ngiurarã tini, cãdzurã pristi mini.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Tuti cãti suntu scriati di ma nãinti, si scriarã trã nvitsãtura a noastrã, cu nãeti tsi, prit arãvdarea sh-prit inimusirea a Scriturilor, s-avem nãdii. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Tora Dumnidzãlu a arãvdariljei sh-a inimusiriljei s-vã da a voauã tra s-minduits idyiul lucru cu un-alantu dupã Hristolu Isus, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />cu nãeti tsi cu unã minti sh-cu unã boatsi s-alãvdats Dumnidzãlu sh-Tatãl a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Trã atsea aprucheats un-alantu ashã dupã cum sh-Hristolu vã apruche trã mãrirea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Cã mini dzãc cã Hristolu s-featsi huzmichear a anvãrliga-tãljeatslor trã luguria a alihiljei al Dumnidzãu, trã alihipsiri tãxirili fapti a pãrintsãlor <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />sh-pãngãnjlji s-multu-mãrescu Dumnidzãlu trã njila a lui, ashã cum easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 15:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Trã aestã, ntrã Pãngãnjlji va tsã da alãvdari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">sh-a numãljei a ta va lji psãltisescu.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Sh-nãpoi elu dzãtsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Hãrsits-vã voi Pãngãnji cu populu a lui!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Sh-nãpoi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Alãvdats Domnul voi tuts Pãngãnji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">shi s-lu alavdã atsel, tuts populjilji!”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Sh-nãpoi Isaia dzãtsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Va yinã arãdãtsina al Iesseu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">meti atsel tsi va si scoalã trã domniri fãrili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">la nãsu va nãdãeascã fãrili.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Dumnidzãlu a nãdiiljei s-vã umplã cu multã harauã sh-pace pistipsinda tu nãsu, tsi voi s-vã artirsits tu nãdii prit putearea a Duhlui Sãmtu.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pavlu, Huzmichearlu al Pãngãnjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Fratsi sh-surãrili a meali, tora sh-mini escu cãndãrsit trã voi, cã sh-voi idyilji hits mplinji di ghineatsã, mplinji di cathi shtintsã sh-hits axi s-urnipsits un-alantu. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Vã scriai cu ma multu curaiu trã niscãnti lucri, tra s-vã-u aduc aminti trã itia a harului tsi nji si deadi di la Dumnidzãlu, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />tra s-hiu mini huzmichearlu a Hristolui Isus trã pãngãnji, huzmitipsinda ca preftu Evanghelu al Dumnidzãu tsi pãngãnjlji si s-facã curbani arsitã shi sãmtsãtã di la Duhlu Sãmtu.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Trã atsea, mini mi alavdu tu Hristolu Isus trã atseali lucri tsi au s-facã cu Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Cã nu va s-cutidzãm pute si zburam ti vãrã lucru tsi Hristolu nu featsi prit mini tra s-aducã ascultarea a pãngãnjilor cu zboari sh-cu fapti, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />prit fuchia a seamnilor sh-a thavmatilor, prit putearea a Duhlui a Dumnidzãlui, ashãtsi cã mini, dit Ierusalem sh-anvãrliga pãnã tu Iliricum, am mplinit dimãndarea a Evanghelui a Hristolui. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ashãtsi cã vrearea a mea fu trã hãbãrsirea a Evanghelui, ma nu aclo iu easti cunuscutã Hristolu, tra s-nu adar pri timeljiul a altui, <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />ma ashã cum easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Atsilor tsi nu lã si dimãndã trã nãsu, va s-veadã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">sh-atselji cai nu au avdzãtã, va aducheascã.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Trã atsea, mi nchidicam di multi ori tra s-yineam la voi. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Tora niavãnda ma loc ti evanghelisiri tu aesti locuri sh-avãnda dor di multi anji s-yin la voi, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />cãntsido s-mi duc Spanjia, nãdãescu tsi tricãnda, s-vã vedu, sh-voi s-mi agiutats cu itsi nji hãrzãeashti trã aclo, dupã tsi s-am hãrsitã ma nãinti di putsãn chiro cu voi. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ma tora ma mi duc tu Ierusalem s-lã huzmitipsescu a oaminjlor al Dumnidzãu aclo. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Cã Machidunia sh-Ahaia deadirã cu harauã agiutãri trã oarfãnjlji la populu a Domnului tu Ierusalem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Aestã a lor u-arsi, ma easti sh-ca borgi cãtrã elji, cã macã pãngãnjlji loarã parti tu Ghinicuvintãrili sufliteascã a Iudeilor, prindi s-lã huzmitipseascã a lor sh-tu lucrili trupeshti. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Trã atsea, dupã tsi va am bitisitã aestã sh-cãndu va am vulusitã a lor aestu agiutor, va mi duc tu Spanjia, tricãnda pri la voi. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Sh-mini shtiu cã yininda la voi, va yin cu mplinãtatea a ghinicuvãntariljei a Hristolui.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Tora vã fac rigeai, frats sh-surãri, prit Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos sh-prit vrearea a Duhlui s-alumtats deadun cu mini tu rugãciunji cãtrã Dumnidzãlu trã mini. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Rugats-vã tra s-ascap di atselji nipistimenji cai suntu tu Iudea sh-huzmitipsirea a mea trã Ierusalemlu s-hibã aprucheat cu harauã trã oaminjlji a Domnului, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />tra s-yinã la voi cu harauã prit vrearea al Dumnidzãu shi s-mi nvãrtushescu di nou deadun cu voi. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Tora Dumnidzãlu a paciljei s-hibã cu voi tuts! Amin!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Salutãrili al Pavlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Vã alasã amaneti sora a noastrã Feba, cai easti diaconã la bisearica tsi easti tu Chencrea, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />tra s-u aprucheats tu Domnul cu tinjii trã oaminjlji a Dumnidzãlui shi s-hits ningã nãsã tu itsido tsi ea ari ananghi di voi, cã sh-ea fu ningã multsã oaminji sh-ningã mini.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Dats sãnãtati la Prishila sh-la Acuila, colucrutorlji a melji tu Hristolu Isus, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />cai trã bana a mea bãgarã tu piricljiu caplu a lor sh-lji hãristisescu nu mash mini, ma sh-tuti biseritsli a pãngãnjilor. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Dats sãnãtati sh-a bisearicãljei la casa a lor. Dats sãnãtati al Epenetu, vrutlu a meu, cai easti protlu carpo ali Asii tu Hristolu. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Dats sãnãtati ali Marii, cai s-cãpãi multu trã voi. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Dats sãnãtati al Andronicu sh-ali Iunia, compatriotsi a melji sh-hãpsãnits deadun cu mini, cai suntu cu anami ntrã apostulji sh-cai furã tu Hristolu nãintea a mea. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Dats sãnãtati al Ampliatu, a vrutlui a meu tu Domnul. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Dats sãnãtati al Urbanu, colucrutorlu a nostru tu Hristolu, sh-al Stacu, vrutlu a meu. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Dats sãnãtati al Apelu, aprovat tu Hristos. Dats-lã sãnãtati di la atselji di casa al Aristobul. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Dats sãnãtati al Herodionu, compatriotlu a meu. Dats sãnãtati atsilor dit casa al Nartsisu, cai suntu tu Domnul. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Dats sãnãtati ali Trifena sh-ali Trifosa, cai s-cãpuescu tu Domnul. Dats sãnãtati a vrutiljei Persida cai s-cãpãi multu tu Domnul. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Dats sãnãtati al Rufu, aleptu tu Domnul, sh-a mumãljei a lui cai easti sh-a mea. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Dats sãnãtati al Asincritu, al Flegonu, al Herma, al Patrobu, al Hermasu sh-a fratsilor sh-a surãrilor cai suntu deadun cu nãshi. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Dats sãnãtati al Filologu, ali Iulia, al Nereu sh-a sorãljei a lui, ali Olimpii sh-a tuts oaminjlor a Domnului cai suntu deadun cu elji. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Dats sãnãtati a unui-alantu cu unã bãshari sãmtã. Vã pitreac sãnãtati tuti biseritsli al Hristos.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Vã fac rigeai, frats sh-surãri, s-vã afirits di atselji tsi fac dispãrtsãri sh-nchidicari contra a nvitsãturãljei cai voi nvitsat. Stats diparti di atselji. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Cã ahtãri oaminji nu lj-huzmitipsescu a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos, ma a pãnticlui a lor sh-prit mushati zboari sh-alãvdãri arãd ininjili atsilor tsi suntu ageamii. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Cãndãrsirea a voastrã agiumsi la tutsã, trã atsea mini mi hãrsescu trã voi sh-voi s-hits froninji trã buna sh-chischinji trã arãulu. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Dumnidzãlu a paciljei va lu dãrãmã curundu Satanlu sum cicioarili a voastri. Harul a Domnului a nostru Isus s-hibã cu voi!<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Vã da sãnãtati Timoteu, colucrutorlu a meu, Lutsiu, Iasonu sh-Sosipatru, compatriotsãlji a melji. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Vã dau sãnãtati tu Domnul mini, Tertsiu, cai scriai cartea. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Vã da sãnãtati Gaiu, ghini-ashtiptãtorlu a meu sh-a tutã bisearicãljei. Vã da sãnãtati Erastu, hãznãtarlu a cãsãbãlui, sh-fratili Cuartu. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />[Harul a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos s-hibã cu voi tuts! Amin!]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu stih nu s-aflã tu manuscrisili atseali veaclji</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Tora atsilui tsi poati s-vã nvãrtusheascã dupã evanghelu a meu sh-dupã predicarea al Isus Hristos prit discupirirea a mistiryiului tsi eara tsãnut ascumtu di multu chiro, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />ma tsi tora s-fãnirusi shi s-featsi cunuscut trã tuti fãrili prit Scriturili a prufitsilor dupã ordinlu al Dumnidzãu di daima trã adutseari cãndãrsirea a pistiljei, <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />a singurlui Dumnidzã mintimen, s-lji hibã mãrirea tu eta a etilor prit Isus Hristos! Amin!<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>